            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "goodfoot"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is fabulous and so easy. I've made it multiple times and changed it to suit my company. I use a pre-made graham cracker crust and changed the topping to canned blueberry instead of cherry. Even better, added a little lemon zest to the filling and used Bonne Maman ( a French jelly maker sometimes found at Walmart) Lemon Curd for the topping. Yummy, yum, yum!",
            "datePublished": "2019-04-10T22:02:34.527Z"
          },
          {
